WEBVTT

00:03:58.292 --> 00:04:00.684
Yet there's also no doubt

00:04:00.708 --> 00:04:04.309
that it was the West
that carried the art of reasoning

00:04:04.333 --> 00:04:06.851
to a much higher level.

00:04:06.875 --> 00:04:08.768
And through the Scientific Revolution,

00:04:08.792 --> 00:04:10.309
the Enlightenment,

00:04:10.333 --> 00:04:12.768
the Industrial Revolution,

00:04:12.792 --> 00:04:16.601
the West really raised it forcefully,

00:04:16.625 --> 00:04:19.684
and equally importantly used this,

00:04:19.708 --> 00:04:25.309
applied it to solve
many major practical problems.

00:04:25.333 --> 00:04:29.393
And the West then shared
this art of applied reasoning

00:04:29.417 --> 00:04:31.184
with the rest of the world,